# --- AMT.engine output (step S6) ---
# Reproduced by `python py/main.py amt`, not archived. The engine loads its
# axioms out of a set, so the order of its amt:provenance lists follows string
# hashing; PYTHONHASHSEED=0 pins that per machine but not across Python
# versions. See PRIMER D-18 -- once the engine sorts, this line can go.
output/*/amt/

# --- Note ---
# data/ and output/ are part of the reproducible archive and are NOT ignored.
# That only works because identical inputs give byte-identical outputs; see
# PRIMER.md, part A3.
PATCH-README.md
*.zip